Goal review is formally closed.

No additional architecture review, critique, amendments, patch proposals, watch items, maintenance notes, calibration suggestions, or alternative designs are requested.

All design decisions should be treated as finalized.

Your task is no longer to review Goal.

Your task is now editorial:

Produce a single fully consolidated Goal artifact generated from your current accepted state.

Instructions:

- Apply every accepted amendment.
- Apply every accepted diff.
- Apply every approved replacement clause.
- Resolve all numbering.
- Resolve all cross-references.
- Remove superseded text.
- Remove deprecated variants.
- Remove changelog entries.
- Remove review commentary.
- Remove rationale sections.
- Remove implementation notes.
- Remove unresolved markers that were resolved during review.

Output only the final merged specification.

Format:

<goal vFinal>
...
</goal>

Do not perform further review.
Do not propose additional changes.
Do not discuss tradeoffs.
